Run python test/run_tests.py from the simon directory.
Requires Python 3 and g++ in PATH. No board and no Arduino framework are needed.

host/core_tests.cpp verifies generation, rules, state transitions, debounce,
protocol, application integration and display data.
host/hardware_tests.cpp compiles real AVR drivers against register models.
WS2812 assembly is built by PlatformIO and still needs board timing verification.
